    <Section Name="Manage_Menu_Aggregation">
      <Phrase Key="Viewer_Title">Aggregation Management Menu</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Intro_Prompt">How would you like to manage this collection today?</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Private_Items_Link">View Private and Dark Items</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Private_Items_Desc">View the private and dark items which are a part of this collection, along with the last milestone information for each item.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Item_Count_Link">View Item Count in Collection</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Item_Count_Desc">View the total item count within this collection, as well as a count of how many items are in currently in process within each major milestone.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Usage_Stats_Link">View History of Collection Use</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Usage_Stats_Desc">View the usage statistics for this collection, and for all items within this collection.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Metadata_Browse_Link">View Metadata Browses</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Metadata_Browse_Desc">View public and/or administrative metadata browses with the complete list of all metadata in the searchable metadata fields for this collection.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Change_Log_Link">View Collection Change Log</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Change_Log_Desc">View the change log for this collection and the design files under this collection.  This does not include the history of digital resources loaded into this collection.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="User_Permissions_Link">View User Permissions</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="User_Permissions_Desc">View special user permissions granted to users over this collection.  This includes permissions assigned individually, as well as permissions assigned through user groups.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Admin_Link">Collection Administration</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Admin_Desc">Perform administrative duties against this collection, changing the appearance, facets, results types, and much more.</Phrase>
    </Section>

